<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Serpents"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Neck Deep"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Life&apos;s Not Out To Get You"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USHR21579007"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="33933853"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="102948306"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="4SqIMK3ILlAsC4FkVgC4Lf"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1716631803"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="157899616"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Fifty-Four54"/></metadata></head><body dur="2:28.900"><div begin="3.500" end="2:28.900"><p begin="3.500" end="5.750" itunes:key="L0" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3.500" end="4.430">Don&apos;t get too</span> <span begin="4.450" end="5.750">close</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">别靠得太近</span></p><p begin="6.100" end="8.370" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="6.100" end="7.100">That place is</span> <span begin="7.110" end="8.370">haunted</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">那个地方闹鬼</span></p><p begin="8.630" end="10.710" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.630" end="9.600">Fear not the</span> <span begin="9.770" end="10.710">ghosts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">别害怕那些幽灵</span></p><p begin="11.000" end="15.300" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="11.000" end="12.170">Cause she sent them</span> <span begin="12.210" end="15.300">running</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为是她把它们驱赶而来的</span></p><p begin="16.200" end="20.650" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.200" end="17.900">She sleeps beneath the</span> <span begin="18.000" end="20.650">surface</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她沉睡于地面之下</span></p><p begin="21.500" end="26.200" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.500" end="23.100">Consorting with the</span> <span begin="23.150" end="26.200">serpents</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">与群蛇为伍</span></p><p begin="26.730" end="33.140" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.730" end="28.400">She strikes without a</span> <span begin="28.490" end="33.140">purpose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她毫无理由地发起侵袭</span></p><p begin="35.100" end="37.200" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.100" end="36.050">A dark face</span> <span begin="36.100" end="36.230">in a</span> <span begin="36.300" end="37.200">corridor</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">走廊深处那张阴暗的脸</span></p><p begin="37.800" end="39.650" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.800" end="38.830">Deceptively</span> <span begin="38.930" end="39.650">beautiful</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">美得近乎虚假</span></p><p begin="39.670" end="41.240" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.670" end="41.240">She&apos;s watching you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她注视着你</span></p><p begin="41.550" end="43.930" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.550" end="41.970">She&apos;s in</span> <span begin="42.000" end="42.900">everything</span> <span begin="42.950" end="43.930">you do</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">潜伏在你做的每件事里</span></p><p begin="45.700" end="47.630" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.700" end="46.300">Her kiss</span> <span begin="46.300" end="46.860">it tastes</span> <span begin="46.860" end="47.630">so sweet</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她的吻甜得令人沉醉</span></p><p begin="47.630" end="50.060" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.630" end="48.490">But left me</span> <span begin="48.490" end="49.150">with a</span> <span begin="49.200" end="50.060">lethargy</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却让我陷入无法挣脱的倦怠</span></p><p begin="50.060" end="51.800" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.060" end="50.450">I</span> <span begin="50.500" end="51.000">couldn&apos;t</span> <span begin="51.000" end="51.800">shake</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我怎么也摆脱不了</span></p><p begin="52.000" end="55.100" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.000" end="52.400">I</span> <span begin="52.500" end="52.920">made a</span> <span begin="52.920" end="53.200">great</span> <span begin="53.200" end="55.100">mistake</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我犯下了一个致命的错误</span></p><p begin="55.850" end="57.180" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.850" end="56.350">I gave her</span> <span begin="56.350" end="57.180">my heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我把心交给了她</span></p><p begin="57.180" end="58.260" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.180" end="57.650">She didn&apos;t</span> <span begin="57.690" end="58.260">want it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可她根本不想要它</span></p><p begin="58.260" end="1:00.900" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.260" end="59.270">Took it anyway</span> <span begin="59.350" end="1:00.000">and put a dark spell</span> <span begin="1:00.000" end="1:00.900">on it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她还是强行夺走并在上面施下黑暗的咒语</span></p><p begin="1:00.900" end="1:05.000" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.900" end="1:01.850">Since then</span> <span begin="1:01.850" end="1:03.000">I haven&apos;t been</span> <span begin="1:03.000" end="1:05.000">the same</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">从那以后我再也不是原来的自己</span></p><p begin="1:05.980" end="1:08.650" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.980" end="1:06.750">Needed a</span> <span begin="1:06.750" end="1:07.570">victim</span> <span begin="1:07.650" end="1:08.000">and she</span> <span begin="1:08.060" end="1:08.650">got it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她需要一个猎物而她得手了</span></p><p begin="1:08.650" end="1:10.050" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.650" end="1:10.050">Took me in with her song</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她用歌声将我引入深渊</span></p><p begin="1:10.080" end="1:11.440" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.080" end="1:10.560">Powerless to</span> <span begin="1:10.560" end="1:11.440">stop it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我毫无抵抗之力</span></p><p begin="1:11.650" end="1:15.800" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.650" end="1:12.270">Some men</span> <span begin="1:12.300" end="1:13.400">don&apos;t dare to speak</span> <span begin="1:13.400" end="1:15.800">her name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有些男人甚至不敢提起她的名字</span></p><p begin="1:27.000" end="1:29.900" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:27.000" end="1:28.340">She picked me up</span> <span begin="1:28.380" end="1:29.120">from my</span> <span begin="1:29.200" end="1:29.900">decline</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她在我最堕落的时候将我捡起</span></p><p begin="1:30.000" end="1:32.650" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.000" end="1:30.970">Healed my wounds</span> <span begin="1:30.980" end="1:31.890">with love and</span> <span begin="1:31.890" end="1:32.650">wine</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">用爱与美酒治愈我的伤口</span></p><p begin="1:32.650" end="1:37.300" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.650" end="1:33.550">Dosed me up</span> <span begin="1:33.550" end="1:34.850">and closed my eyes</span> <span begin="1:34.850" end="1:35.750">a taste of</span> <span begin="1:35.880" end="1:37.300">poison</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她让我沉醉再轻轻闭上我的双眼，那是一口毒药</span></p><p begin="1:37.450" end="1:40.300" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.450" end="1:38.900">She gave me all</span> <span begin="1:38.900" end="1:39.500">that I</span> <span begin="1:39.500" end="1:40.300">desired</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她给了我所有渴望的一切</span></p><p begin="1:40.400" end="1:43.050" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.400" end="1:41.600">Sung the songs of</span> <span begin="1:41.600" end="1:43.050">angel choirs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">吟唱着如天使圣歌般的旋律</span></p><p begin="1:43.100" end="1:47.600" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.100" end="1:46.000">Preached the words of death and fire and left me</span> <span begin="1:46.150" end="1:47.600">burning</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却宣讲着死亡与烈火的预言，最后只留下我独自在火中燃烧</span></p><p begin="1:47.800" end="1:49.000" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.800" end="1:48.590">I gave her my</span> <span begin="1:48.590" end="1:49.000">heart</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我把心交给了她</span></p><p begin="1:49.000" end="1:50.150" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.000" end="1:49.240">She</span> <span begin="1:49.240" end="1:49.500">didn&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:49.550" end="1:50.150">want it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">可她根本不想要它</span></p><p begin="1:50.150" end="1:53.000" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:50.150" end="1:51.050">Took it anyway</span> <span begin="1:51.050" end="1:52.170">and put a dark spell</span> <span begin="1:52.170" end="1:53.000">on it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她还是夺走了它并施下黑暗的咒语</span></p><p begin="1:53.050" end="1:56.880" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.050" end="1:53.760">Since then</span> <span begin="1:53.760" end="1:54.900">I haven&apos;t been</span> <span begin="1:54.900" end="1:56.880">the same</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">从那以后我再也不是从前的我</span></p><p begin="1:58.000" end="2:00.500" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:58.000" end="1:59.450">Needed a victim</span> <span begin="1:59.450" end="1:59.950">and she</span> <span begin="1:59.950" end="2:00.500">got it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她需要一个受害者，而她找到了我</span></p><p begin="2:00.570" end="2:01.900" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.570" end="2:01.900">Took me in with her song</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她用歌声诱惑我沉沦</span></p><p begin="2:01.900" end="2:03.300" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:01.900" end="2:02.500">Powerless to</span> <span begin="2:02.500" end="2:03.300">stop it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我根本无力反抗</span></p><p begin="2:03.500" end="2:07.600" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.500" end="2:04.100">Some men</span> <span begin="2:04.150" end="2:05.330">don&apos;t dare to speak</span> <span begin="2:05.330" end="2:07.600">her name</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">有些男人甚至不敢说出她的名字</span></p><p begin="2:11.600" end="2:16.600" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.600" end="2:13.500">She sleeps beneath the</span> <span begin="2:13.600" end="2:16.600">surface</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她沉睡于深渊之下</span></p><p begin="2:17.000" end="2:21.800" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.000" end="2:18.650">Consorting with the</span> <span begin="2:18.700" end="2:21.800">serpents</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">与蛇群低语相伴</span></p><p begin="2:22.000" end="2:28.900" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.000" end="2:23.920">She strikes without a</span> <span begin="2:23.980" end="2:28.900">purpose</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她毫无理由地发起侵袭</span></p></div></body></tt>